k, according to the deck?',1691,'B. PESTEL',1,'2026-06-22 09:43:01','2026-06-22 09:43:01'),(4476,289,491,'8. The micro environment acronym “COSMIC” mentioned in the deck includes which of the following groups?',1695,'B. Capital, Operations, Sales, Marketing, Innovation, Costs',0,'2026-06-22 09:43:01','2026-06-22 09:43:01'),(4477,289,492,'9. Niche marketing, as described in the deck, is best characterized by:',1699,'B. A targeted strategy focusing on a specific, well-defined, narrow market segment',1,'2026-06-22 09:43:01','2026-06-22 09:43:01'),(4478,289,493,'10. In Porter\'s Five Forces (used for competitor analysis in the deck), bargaining power of suppliers tends to be HIGH when:',1703,'B. Suppliers are few in number and demand is high',1,'2026-06-22 09:43:01','2026-06-22 09:43:01'),(4479,289,494,'11. Which of the following is NOT listed in the deck as a barrier for new entrants?',1707,'B. Brand loyalty (product differentiation)',0,'2026-06-22 09:43:01','2026-06-22 09:43:01'),(4480,289,495,'12. “Benchmarking,” as defined in the deck, refers to: A. Measuring a company\'s products, services, or performance against industry leaders or competitors to identify strengths and weaknesses',1710,'A. Measuring a company\'s products, services, or performance against industry leaders or competitors to identify strengths and weaknesses',1,'2026-06-22 09:43:01','2026-06-22 09:43:01'),(4481,289,496,'13. SWOT analysis is used to evaluate which four elements?',1715,'B. Strengths, Weaknesses, Opportunities, Threats',1,'2026-06-22 09:43:01','2026-06-22 09:43:01'),(4482,289,497,'14. TOWS (TWOS) analysis extends SWOT by developing four strategy types. Which pair below is correctly matched to its description?',1718,'A. SO = maxi-maxi (use strengths to maximize opportunities)',1,'2026-06-22 09:43:01','2026-06-22 09:43:01'),(4483,289,498,'15. In an EFAS (External Factor Analysis Summary) table, what must all assigned weights sum to, regardless of the number of factors?',1723,'B. 1.00',1,'